#. inDungeon
msgctxt "555852"
msgid "…but it's scary being alone…"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "556004"
msgid "!rmap>#000001BC"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "556100"
msgid "Hey. Come on, don't you understand?\nIt's all over."
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "556424"
msgid "I'm perplexed.\nHave you even heard of giving up?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "557416"
msgid "―――!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "558392"
msgid "Do you realize what you've done?\nThis is a servant that must never be awakened."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "558584"
msgid "―――#C236196003BB#CDEF's eyes lack their usual glow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "559820"
msgid "There you have it, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nSo? I don't mind either way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "560632"
msgid "I should――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "561092"
msgid "…that was unexpected. #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF\nquietly departed without commenting on my decision."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "561456"
msgid "Hmph. Those were offerings to me.\nWhy must I hand them over?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "561832"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "561848"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF looks down at me, silent…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "561904"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF looks down at me, silent…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "561960"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF looks down at me, silent…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "562016"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF looks down at me, silent…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "562628"
msgid "――――I'll lose, my ability, to beg for, help――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "562728"
msgid "―――Ahh―――but, now, like this I―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "562932"
msgid "Oh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "563048"
msgid "So then why value your contract with\nhim over me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "563100"
msgid "…#C236196003BB#CDEF does make a good point."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "563148"
msgid "I can call him my \"Servant,\" but #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF isn't my ally.\nI never know on what whim he may mow me down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "564096"
msgid "You―――\nYou STOLE #[his][her]# #C000246204Command Seals#CDEF,\nshamelessly―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "564288"
msgid "#C236196003G-Gilgamesh#CDEF―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "564452"
msgid "―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "564860"
msgid "Subjectiveness, sound asleep."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "564916"
msgid "Objectiveness, up and active."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "565096"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "566312"
msgid "\n\n\n#C255045045――――due to censorship within this memory sector,\nit cannot be sorted.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "566408"
msgid "#C255045045Reverify your / my situation.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "568088"
msgid "――Where am I?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "568112"
msgid "#SVT, is that you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "568248"
msgid "Wait… could this be…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "569180"
msgid "…could it be?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "569620"
msgid "Torture is driven by someone's intent."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "569736"
msgid "But."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "569748"
msgid "What if this were being done \"for no reason\"?\nWhat if this world is always this way―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "569896"
msgid "……!"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "569904"
msgid "…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "569948"
msgid "…despondency and drowsiness rapidly assail me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "570216"
msgid "\nAhh, but―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "570940"
msgid "#C231232226It's unclear whether I'm alive or dead.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "571004"
msgid "Hehe, hehehe―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572324"
msgid "You have nothing. No chance of escape.\nNo chance of surviving.\nI mean, look how weak you are!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572608"
msgid "#C188189194…that's right.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572640"
msgid "#C188189194…we lost. Completely defeated.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573268"
msgid "How embaaarassing.\nYou look like a―no, you ARE a dog, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573636"
msgid "#C110110110…#[yeah][mhmm]#. Even I'm well aware of it.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574208"
msgid "#C090090090…I've accepted it completely.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574652"
msgid "Ooookay, welcome everyone☆\n\"I went to start a new game, but suddenly\nit's Punishment Time Seven…\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574856"
msgid "The lovey-dovey #C000246204BB Channel#CDEF / Zero begins! Now!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574928"
msgid "You know this already,\nbut round 1 is the quiz corner. \nPlease identify what my three #C000246204SGs#CDEF are."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575232"
msgid "…I still don't get what #C236196003BB#CDEF is on about."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575296"
msgid "All I got from that was the \"dramatic twist\" part."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575624"
msgid "…oh. Well then, to be honest, I DO have a few words for her.\nMy cheeky kouhai is in need of a reality check."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575736"
msgid "I accept the challenge…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575984"
msgid "I see you wanting to ravage me!\nJust like in those doujinshi!\nThose dirty douji―YEOWCH!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576220"
msgid "…oops. My hand slipped.\nBut hey, that stopped this from taking a raunchy turn."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576928"
msgid "…well, well.\nI was ready for her condescending act."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577220"
msgid "I took damage…!?\nWait a second, is this the kind of game where\ntoo many losses means death!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577316"
msgid "Of course. I won't hesitate to even\ndelete all your save data―if you want, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577956"
msgid "In this mode, #C236196003BB#CDEF's baffling and broken skills have no effect."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578228"
msgid "Lies."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578400"
msgid "I've been a wonderful queen, surrounded by\ndelightful subordinates like #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF,\n#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF, #C236196003Green Tea#CDEF, and #C236196003Eli#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578580"
msgid "It's hard to say that #C236196003Lip#CDEF or #C236196003Melt#CDEF even listened to her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578672"
msgid "Same went for the #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF and #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578932"
msgid "T-there's no proof of that…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579124"
msgid "Gah…!\nA-about that―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579396"
msgid "Kyaaaaaaa!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579420"
msgid "W-wait!\nThat was simply a means achievable for an AI!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579572"
msgid "Nay!\nYou do as your Senpai says!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579652"
msgid "Ah, o-okay!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579672"
msgid "…ahem.\nS-sure, I'm not denying that you're my Senpai,\nSenpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579976"
msgid "With all these meticulously arranged meanderings,\ndid she think I wouldn't notice?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580064"
msgid "H-huh…? Did I #ROFS0002#RUBSscrew#RUBEmess#REND something up?\n…I've been trying to keep things secret,\ndead honest…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580196"
msgid "THAT'S how she intended to hide it…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580336"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF's second #C000246204SG#CDEF is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580420"
msgid "Naive. So naive!\nFigures, Senpai.\nYou're the big dummy I always knew you were."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581088"
msgid "And so, #C236196003BB#CDEF's second #C000246204SG#CDEF is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581160"
msgid "……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581172"
msgid "It's obvious what it is,\nbut let's review a few points."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581360"
msgid "T-that was just on a whim!\nI found a decent place and repurposed it to\nstore human data, that's it…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581544"
msgid "Gah… but White put up that barrier, you know…\nI wanted so many times to crash the party,\nhonest…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581652"
msgid "Yep, that was her intention all along."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581876"
msgid "P-PLEASE stop!\nIt's so embarrassing!\nAghh, you're right, though!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582628"
msgid "Gulp…!\nN-no, you have it all wrong.\nThose events were strategic in nature."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583044"
msgid "If she likes something, then why can't she\njust be honest and say it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583500"
msgid "It's simple. #C236196003BB#CDEF's third #C000246204SG#CDEF will offer the explanation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583588"
msgid "I say―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583716"
msgid "Oh, right…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583828"
msgid "I say―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583972"
msgid "Obvious truths don't make for good secrets."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584016"
msgid "The problem with #C236196003BB#CDEF is how she's not forthright."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584228"
msgid "KYAAA! S-stop! My clothes are slipping―――\nM-m-mercy, Senpai!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584772"
msgid "W-well…\nI can't just do a 180…\nAnd I'm trying to cut down on butter…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585064"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF is writhing in tears.\nWith her #C000246204SGs#CDEF exposed, #C236196003BB#CDEF has no way to resist."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585428"
msgid "Ahh, uhh…!\nOkay! I apologgggiiizzzeee!\nIt was all my faaaauuullllt!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585620"
msgid "Good.\nAnd with that, all #C000246204BB Channel#CDEF viewers should be happy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585752"
msgid "Huff… huff… huff…\nThank goodness…\nSo, my punishment is over now, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585832"
msgid "Now I can get out of this\nembarrassing pose, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586004"
msgid "But #C236196003BB#CDEF still isn't repentant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586304"
msgid "I-I had my reasons!\nI know you know that, Senpai.\nWhy are you so forgetful!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586844"
msgid "Hya…!\nS-Senpai, don't yell at me so loudly…\nIt's like my whole body is being squeezed――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587272"
msgid "Senpai―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587608"
msgid "\"Precious\"――\nBut… I spent so, so long becoming stronger,\nand now I am."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587904"
msgid "…?\nIs there anything wrong with #C236196003BB#CDEF losing to #C236196003#FAMILY\n#GIVEN#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588176"
msgid "And that's how… one day, suddenly,\nyou'll be gone… I won't be able to\nhandle that…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588360"
msgid "…that's why I can't lose to you.\nI can't bear to see you off and\nend up alone now…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588528"
msgid "Together…?\nI've changed so much, though.\nYou would still let me go with you…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588608"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588812"
msgid "That's, that's…\nI'm happy…\nNo―I shouldn't, I shouldn't, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588880"
msgid "Ahh, Senpai… #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF…\nI've always loved you."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "588952"
msgid "I know."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "588992"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589528"
msgid "No, it's okay…\nYou've made it abundantly clear how you\nfeel, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589604"
msgid "You told me that you accept me for who I am――\nNow my mind is made up!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589776"
msgid "I won't let a little punishment reform me!\nI'm the grown up, evil, stunning\nQueen of the Moon―#C236196003BB#CDEF!鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590288"
msgid "…! O-okay… I'm glad…\nI'm so glad, Senpai!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590372"
msgid "Yep, one has to set the evildoer\nstraight, fair and square, right!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590544"
msgid "…uhh."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590556"
msgid "I got you, Senpai!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590736"
msgid "W-what happened…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591176"
msgid "So please just wait a short, short moment\nfor me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591360"
msgid "Got it, Se-n-pa-i?\nBe very good and sit tight for me, okay♪"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602456"
msgid "―――But it's not a particularly big deal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602556"
msgid "―――But it's not an especially unusual thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602604"
msgid "…stop right there.\nPlease stop.\nStop. Stop. STOP…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602880"
msgid "………no. That's, wrong."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603452"
msgid "THAT, I stubbornly protected.\nTHAT, has been my pride."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604080"
msgid "But there's no way I can escape this thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604792"
msgid "#C236196003Julius#CDEF……!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605452"
msgid "You had turned into a ghost, and I saved you.\nYet THIS is how you repay me!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605544"
msgid "Dead on. That's what you get, using ghosts. I\nbecame a ghost out of hatred for #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nAfter that, I remained due to other regrets."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606432"
msgid "#C236196003Julius#CDEF, you…… #C236196003Julius#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "607232"
msgid "…I really do know nothing.\n#C236196003Julius#CDEF, he―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "607540"
msgid "Friends…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "607552"
msgid "#C236196003Julius#CDEF and I?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "607668"
msgid "…that's right. You didn't know?\nYou, #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF,\nare my one and only friend."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "607868"
msgid "Go―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "608160"
msgid "#C236196003Julius#CDEF#C075075075―――!#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "609016"
msgid "Ooookay, welcome everyone☆\n\"I went to start a new game, but suddenly\nit's Punishment Time Seven…\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "609220"
msgid "#C000246204Love-Love BB Channel/Zero#CDEF,\nshall begin! Now!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "609292"
msgid "You know this already,\nbut round 1 is the quiz corner. \nPlease identify what my three #C000246204SGs#CDEF are."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "609596"
msgid "…I still don't get what #C236196003BB#CDEF is on about."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "609660"
msgid "All I got from that was the \"dramatic twist\" part."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "609988"
msgid "…oh. Well then, to be honest, I DO have a few words for her.\nMy cheeky kouhai is in need of a reality check."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "610100"
msgid "I accept the challenge…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "610348"
msgid "I see you wanting to ravage me!\nJust like in those doujinshi!\nThose dirty douji―YEOWCH!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "610584"
msgid "…oops. My hand slipped.\nBut hey, that stopped this from taking a raunchy turn."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611292"
msgid "…well, well.\nI was ready for her condescending act."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611604"
msgid "I took damage…!?\nWait a second, is this the kind of game where\ntoo many losses means death!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611700"
msgid "Of course. I won't hesitate to even\ndelete all your save data―if you want, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "612352"
msgid "In this mode, #C236196003BB#CDEF's baffling and broken skills have no effect."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "612624"
msgid "Lies."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "612800"
msgid "I've been a wonderful queen, surrounded by\ndelightful subordinates like #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF,\n#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF, #C236196003Green Tea#CDEF, and #C236196003Eli#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "612980"
msgid "It's hard to say that #C236196003Lip#CDEF or #C236196003Melt#CDEF even listened to her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "613072"
msgid "Same went for the #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF and #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "613332"
msgid "T-there's no proof of that…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "613524"
msgid "Gah…!\nA-about that―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "613796"
msgid "Kyaaaaaaa!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "613820"
msgid "W-wait!\nThat was simply a means achievable for an AI!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "613972"
msgid "Nay!\nYou do as your Senpai says!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614052"
msgid "Ah, o-okay!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614072"
msgid "…ahem.\nS-sure, I'm not denying that you're my Senpai,\nSenpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614376"
msgid "With all these meticulously arranged meanderings,\ndid she think I wouldn't notice?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614464"
msgid "H-huh…? Did I #ROFS0002#RUBSscrew#RUBEmess#REND something up?\n…I've been trying to keep things secret,\ndead honest…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614596"
msgid "THAT'S how she intended to hide it…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614736"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF's second #C000246204SG#CDEF is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614840"
msgid "Naive. So naive!\nFigures, Senpai.\nYou're the big dummy I always knew you were."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615512"
msgid "And so, #C236196003BB#CDEF's second #C000246204SG#CDEF is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615604"
msgid "……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615616"
msgid "It's obvious what it is,\nbut let's review a few points."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615804"
msgid "T-that was just on a whim!\nI found a decent place and repurposed it to\nstore human data, that's it…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615988"
msgid "Gah… but White put up that barrier, you know…\nI wanted so many times to crash the party,\nhonest…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616096"
msgid "Yep, that was her intention all along."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616320"
msgid "P-PLEASE stop!\nIt's so embarrassing!\nAghh, you're right, though!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617092"
msgid "Gulp…!\nN-no, you have it all wrong.\nThose events were strategic in nature."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617508"
msgid "If she likes something, then why can't she\njust be honest and say it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617964"
msgid "It's simple. #C236196003BB#CDEF's third #C000246204SG#CDEF will offer the explanation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618052"
msgid "I say―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618200"
msgid "Oh, right…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618312"
msgid "I say―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618476"
msgid "Obvious truths don't make for good secrets."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618520"
msgid "The problem with #C236196003BB#CDEF is how she's not forthright."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618752"
msgid "KYAAA! S-stop! My clothes are slipping―――\nM-m-mercy, Senpai!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619296"
msgid "W-well…\nI can't just do a 180…\nAnd I'm trying to cut down on butter…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619604"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF is writhing in tears.\nWith her #C000246204SGs#CDEF exposed, #C236196003BB#CDEF has no way to resist."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619988"
msgid "Ahh, uhh…!\nOkay! I apologgggiiizzzeee!\nIt was all my faaaauuullllt!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620180"
msgid "Good.\nAnd with that, all #C000246204BB Channel#CDEF viewers should be happy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620312"
msgid "Huff… huff… huff…\nThank goodness…\nSo, my punishment is over now, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620392"
msgid "Now I can get out of this\nembarrassing pose, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620556"
msgid "But #C236196003BB#CDEF still isn't repentant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620856"
msgid "I-I had my reasons!\nI know you know that, Senpai.\nWhy are you so forgetful!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621416"
msgid "Hya…!\nS-Senpai, don't yell at me so loudly…\nIt's like my whole body is being squeezed――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621844"
msgid "Senpai―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622180"
msgid "\"Precious\"――\nBut… I spent so, so long becoming stronger,\nand now I am."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622476"
msgid "…?\nIs there anything wrong with #C236196003BB#CDEF losing to #C236196003#FAMILY\n#GIVEN#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622748"
msgid "And that's how… one day, suddenly,\nyou'll be gone… I won't be able to\nhandle that…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622932"
msgid "…that's why I can't lose to you.\nI can't bear to see you off and\nend up alone now…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623120"
msgid "Together…?\nI've changed so much, though.\nYou would still let me go with you…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623200"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623404"
msgid "That's, that's…\nI'm happy…\nNo―I shouldn't, I shouldn't, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623472"
msgid "Ahh, Senpai… #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF…\nI've always loved you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624304"
msgid "No, it's okay…\nYou've made it abundantly clear how you\nfeel, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624380"
msgid "You told me that you accept me for who I am――\nNow my mind is made up!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624552"
msgid "I won't let a little punishment reform me!\nI'm the grown up, evil, stunning\nQueen of the Moon―#C236196003BB#CDEF!鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624788"
msgid "#C080080080!?#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625148"
msgid "…! O-okay… I'm glad…\nI'm so glad, Senpai!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625232"
msgid "Yep, one has to set the evildoer\nstraight, fair and square, right!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625404"
msgid "…uhh."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625416"
msgid "I got you, Senpai!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625616"
msgid "W-what happened…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "626040"
msgid "So please just wait a short, short moment\nfor me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "626224"
msgid "Got it, Se-n-pa-i?\nBe very good and sit tight for me, okay♪"
msgstr ""

